{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This operator is an alias for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"broadcast()"},{"type":"text","text":", providing identical behavior."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed."}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO4JustV","title":"share()","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113","fileName":"ShareSequence.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"share"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just\/share()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/just\/share()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent","type":"topic","title":"Afluent","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","role":"collection","abstract":[]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AsyncSequences","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/Just/share()":{"title":"share()","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just\/share()","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"Element","type":